WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:01.931
- And me getting my Oscar.

00:00:01.931 --> 00:00:03.672
And I wanna thank Sophie Turner,

00:00:03.672 --> 00:00:05.465
'cause she's the best thing
that ever happened to me.

00:00:05.465 --> 00:00:09.677
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:09.677 --> 00:00:11.325
- [woman in blue] We're gonna
have you hold up this picture

00:00:11.325 --> 00:00:14.971
of Leonardo DiCaprio, and
put it next to your face,

00:00:14.971 --> 00:00:16.665
and I'm gonna swap your faces.

00:00:16.665 --> 00:00:17.405
- (laughing) Okay.

00:00:17.405 --> 00:00:18.648
- [woman in blue] You look fabulous,

00:00:18.648 --> 00:00:19.581
do you feel good about it?

00:00:19.581 --> 00:00:20.641
- Oh, I feel so good.

00:00:20.641 --> 00:00:23.216
- [woman] Obviously you
know Leo DiCaprio very well.

00:00:23.216 --> 00:00:23.959
- Yes.

00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:24.906
- Do you wanna swap faces?

00:00:24.906 --> 00:00:26.346
Hold this for a second, and we'll do it.

00:00:26.346 --> 00:00:27.939
- Sure, oh m god.

00:00:27.939 --> 00:00:30.079
This is kind of unholy.

00:00:30.079 --> 00:00:31.263
My acceptance speech?

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:32.592
I probably thank all Native Americans,

00:00:32.592 --> 00:00:34.508
including that one handsome
one named Forrest Goodluck.

00:00:34.508 --> 00:00:36.159
- [woman in blue] So there's
a filter that just came out,

00:00:36.159 --> 00:00:37.598
like swap-your-face filter.

00:00:37.598 --> 00:00:38.597
- I love that filter!

00:00:38.597 --> 00:00:40.245
- You're about to do it with Leo.

00:00:40.245 --> 00:00:41.313
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:41.313 --> 00:00:43.287
I really wanna thank the bear,

00:00:43.287 --> 00:00:46.722
'cause he was a really
big part in my Oscar.

00:00:46.722 --> 00:00:47.475
(laughing)

00:00:47.475 --> 00:00:49.639
Oh my god, that's so,

00:00:49.639 --> 00:00:51.775
look at, oh no that's terrible.

00:00:51.775 --> 00:00:53.447
(laughing)

00:00:53.447 --> 00:00:55.861
- [woman in blue] Isn't that amazing?

00:00:55.861 --> 00:00:57.662
Isn't that crazy? (laughing)

00:00:57.662 --> 00:00:58.703
So basically you just hold it

00:00:58.703 --> 00:01:00.426
next to your face really close.

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:02.005
- What, am I supposed to be talking?

00:01:02.005 --> 00:01:03.607
Oh you're filming?

00:01:03.607 --> 00:01:05.441
Leo, what do you think
of your chances tonight?

00:01:05.441 --> 00:01:06.904
100%, dude, easy.

00:01:06.904 --> 00:01:07.856
It's in the bag.

00:01:07.856 --> 00:01:12.681
I would say, "Go to change.org/era,

00:01:12.681 --> 00:01:14.423
"and get women equal rights in America."

00:01:14.423 --> 00:01:15.695
- Have you guys done this face swap?

00:01:15.695 --> 00:01:16.601
- Yes, yes, I have it.

00:01:16.601 --> 00:01:20.757
(upbeat music)

00:01:20.757 --> 00:01:22.684
- Thanks to everybody, thanks to director,

00:01:22.684 --> 00:01:24.170
Thanks to the Hawk!

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:26.074
Yeah, the Hawk in the movie, The Revenant.

00:01:26.074 --> 00:01:27.165
He's a great guy.

00:01:27.165 --> 00:01:30.300
(laughing)

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.915
- Oh my god, with Leo
with a (voice fades out).

00:01:32.915 --> 00:01:35.812
(upbeat instrumental music)

